{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46943","headline":"秋夕言怀寄所知 · 齐己","name":"秋夕言怀寄所知","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"休问蒙庄材不材，孤灯影共傍寒灰。\n忘筌话道心甘死，候体论诗口懒开。\n窗外风涛连建业，梦中云水忆天台。\n相疎却是相知分，谁讶经年一度来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46943.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46943","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}